    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Hinckley Association Football Club is a football club, from Hinckley, Leicestershire, who play home games at Heather St Johns' St John's Park, from the 2014–15 season. The club was formed in January 2014 when fans of the dissolved Hinckley United formed their own Community Trust football club, owned and democratically run by its supporters. The club competes in the Midland League Division One .",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
